# Reference Point — Hybrid Chat Head (`.hybrid-chat-head`)

When the user says **"reference point"** for the hybrid chat intro block (e.g. "AI + Human, One Chat"), match `header.hybrid-chat-head` in `#ai-layer` → `.hybrid-chat`.

## Structure

```html
<header class="hybrid-chat-head">
  <p class="eyebrow soft">Chatbot experience</p>
  <h3 class="title">AI + Human, One Chat</h3>
  <p class="lead">Simple questions are answered instantly. High-stakes moments—like gemstone provenance—escalate to specialists in the same thread.</p>
</header>
```

Equivalent to `.overview-sub-head.stack-16` — same eyebrow + title treatment, different wrapper class.

## Visual spec — title (`h3.title`)

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Element | `h3.title` inside `.hybrid-chat-head` |
| Font | `var(--serif)` → Instrument Serif |
| Size | `var(--title-sm)` → **clamp(1.6rem, 2.6vw, 2.25rem)** |
| Weight | **400** |
| Style | **Regular** (not italic); use `<em>` for phrase emphasis only |
| Color | `var(--ink-deep)` → **#1a1814** |
| Line-height | **1.1** |
| Max-width | **40rem** |
| Margin | **0** |

See also `reference-point-sub-title.mdc` (shared selector) and `reference-point-eyebrow-soft.mdc` (label above).

## Visual spec — wrapper

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Wrapper | `.hybrid-chat-head` |
| Layout | column flex, `gap: 0.75rem` |
| Max-width | **52rem** |

## Visual spec — lead (optional third line)

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Element | `.hybrid-chat-head .lead` |
| Size | **1rem** |
| Line-height | **1.6** |
| Color | **#544d4b** |
| Max-width | **42rem** |

## Scoped CSS

```css
.hybrid-chat-head .eyebrow.soft { /* see reference-point-eyebrow-soft.mdc */ }
.hybrid-chat-head h3.title { /* see reference-point-sub-title.mdc */ }
.hybrid-chat-head .lead { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #544d4b; }
```

## vs other headlines

| Class / element | Use |
|-----------------|-----|
| **`h3.title` in `.hybrid-chat-head`** | **Subsection head — regular serif, `--title-sm`** |
| `.hybrid-chat-rationale-title` | Rationale column — separate component |
| `.hybrid-chat-demo-title` | In-phone demo canvas — UI mockup scale |
| `.display` | Main section heads — largest, `--display` |

## Do not

- Use `h2` or a custom class (e.g. `.hybrid-chat-title`) — always `h3.title`.
- Use brown `.eyebrow` — subsection label is `.eyebrow.soft`.
- Match global `h3` / `h3.title` base size (`--h3`) — subsection titles use `--title-sm` via scoped selector.
- Confuse with `.ai-touchpoint-head h4` — touchpoint card heads are 24px italic.
